# Amount swept from 0 to 255 at P2 0 (clean glue) on a loud (-3 dBFS) sawtooth: its peaks come down by 6 dB (auto
# make-up holds -12 dBFS peaks, so louder input ends up quieter).
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 0.5
track fx2
input saw 110 0.7
sweep p1 0 255 0 32
param p2 0
param pan 128
param level 255
gain 1
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below -0.1
